<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>¡Programado! | Desayuno Flash</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-md w-full px-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8 text-center border-t-4 border-green-500">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-green-100 text-green-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mx-auto mb-6">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check-double"></i>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">¡Todo listo, <%= customer_name %>!</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Tu desayuno ha sido programado con éxito para mañana.</p>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg text-left mb-6">
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Hora de entrega exacta:</p>
                <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-green-500"></i> <%= scheduled_time %></p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Orden #DF-<%= orderId.toString().padStart(4, '0') %></p>
            </div>
            
            <a href="/" class="block w-full bg-gray-900 hover:bg-black text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition">
                Volver al Inicio
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
